{"id":1596,"title":"二叉树数组表示法","summary":"导言","tags":"","components":[{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c526e4f4-a4ab-3b58-b993-9db3a27c30dc","knowledge_id":769,"title":"导言","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":0,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":769,"title":"导言","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"bf71770f-252c-35f3-bf0e-965a3b16db9d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"我们知道，二叉树包含两个基本信息：\n\n- 结点包含的数据\n- 结点之间的关系\n\n请看下面这棵树：","text_html":"<p>我们知道，二叉树包含两个基本信息：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>结点包含的数据</li>\n<li>结点之间的关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>请看下面这棵树：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"c08a8ac4-c139-3c4c-abfa-5ed204f6088d","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/5a8a5d77b10a9ee39f0b.png","style":"original","caption":"A Binary Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":602,"size_in_bytes":27316,"name":"dsa-12.1.1.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7fd44301-c04e-3e0f-8378-c276e66a9874","title":"","title_html":"","text":"绘制树形图既耗时又浪费空间。因此，可以将用数组或列表来表示树。\n\n在数组中：\n\n- 数组中存储结点的数据。\n- 数组的位置代表结点之间的关系。","text_html":"<p>绘制树形图既耗时又浪费空间。因此，可以将用数组或列表来表示树。</p>\n<p>在数组中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数组中存储结点的数据。</li>\n<li>数组的位置代表结点之间的关系。</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"8667c9cc-666c-30a2-ab60-a0937faf1256","knowledge_id":770,"title":"数组表示法","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":770,"title":"数组表示法","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"b2edaa30-058b-31d2-884b-b4c09749c36e","title":"","title_html":"","text":"再看同一棵树，这次给结点**编号**:","text_html":"<p>再看同一棵树，这次给结点<strong>编号</strong>:</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3fc515d0-f0a4-33db-b93e-acb2471b3b27","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/8a466e4f2a6044bd9443.png","style":"original","caption":"Numbered Node Array Representation of a Binary Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":662,"size_in_bytes":30941,"name":"dsa-12.1.2.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"40cb7bf1-6361-3a2e-a74e-880ac6d5710d","title":"","title_html":"","text":"数组表示法为：","text_html":"<p>数组表示法为：</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7eccf027-b9d4-3413-af46-7d5eef479875","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/57c370a444b618ab2389.png","style":"original","caption":"Array Representation of a Binary Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":318,"size_in_bytes":8419,"name":"dsa-12.1.3.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"Note","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"5899abf7-307e-379f-8bb3-c6207be77c6d","text":"为便于理解这一概念，数组位置从**1**开始计数。","text_html":"<p>为便于理解这一概念，数组位置从<strong>1</strong>开始计数。</p>"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"bb6f76a2-21c2-35e6-bac8-a0c36f146401","title":"","title_html":"","text":"对于数组中位置 `i` 处的任何结点：\n\n- 左子结点位于位置 `2i`。\n- 右子结点位于位置 `2i + 1` 处。\n- 父结点位于位置 `floor(i/2)`。","text_html":"<p>对于数组中位置 <code>i</code> 处的任何结点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>左子结点位于位置 <code>2i</code>。</li>\n<li>右子结点位于位置 <code>2i + 1</code> 处。</li>\n<li>父结点位于位置 <code>floor(i/2)</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":5}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"23e4ec07-0dc3-3b2f-a481-ee6cb26f7385","knowledge_id":771,"title":"数组表示法的工作原理","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":2,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":771,"title":"数组表示法的工作原理","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2b5b5646-9a59-3439-98fc-aeffd3796358","title":"","title_html":"","text":"由于 `A` 是根结点，将把它插入第1个位置。","text_html":"<p>由于 <code>A</code> 是根结点，将把它插入第1个位置。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"aceac70f-32f6-39f8-b753-5e9493167eef","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/cbf3d0aa92b44339afcd.png","style":"original","caption":"Inserting the Root Node (A) into the Array Representation","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":318,"size_in_bytes":5949,"name":"dsa-12.1.4.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"f71e94cd-75f6-3b89-9265-b5760c478305","title":"","title_html":"","text":"`B` 是 `A` 的左子结点：\n\n```text\nB: 2 * 1 = 2\n```\n\n`C` 是 `A` 的右子结点：\n\n```text\nC: 2 * 1 + 1 = 3\n```","text_html":"<p><code>B</code> 是 <code>A</code> 的左子结点：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">B: 2 * 1 = 2\n</code></pre>\n<p><code>C</code> 是 <code>A</code> 的右子结点：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">C: 2 * 1 + 1 = 3\n</code></pre>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0ea412e4-858c-3bc9-8d3d-a70a703e9cb7","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/976ec81d7e0031de945a.png","style":"original","caption":"Calculating Positions of Child Nodes (B and C) in the Array Representation","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":318,"size_in_bytes":7168,"name":"dsa-12.1.5.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"a7136a41-3385-3cb2-af5a-464e9a7868dc","title":"","title_html":"","text":"`D` 和 `E` 是 `B` 的子结点。\n\n由于 `B` 位于位置**2**：\n\n```text\nD: 2 * 2 = 4\nE: 2 * 2 + 1 = 5\n```","text_html":"<p><code>D</code> 和 <code>E</code> 是 <code>B</code> 的子结点。</p>\n<p>由于 <code>B</code> 位于位置<strong>2</strong>：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-text\">D: 2 * 2 = 4\nE: 2 * 2 + 1 = 5\n</code></pre>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7927afa3-ed6a-3cb6-b526-a5ab5c43f6af","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/63bb626c2e9c3a7ef4a4.png","style":"original","caption":"Calculating Positions of Child Nodes (D and E) of Node B","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":318,"size_in_bytes":7646,"name":"dsa-12.1.6.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ceccc3ba-7b12-3b9b-8403-9c512798082a","title":"","title_html":"","text":"同样，`F`和`G`是`C`的子结点。","text_html":"<p>同样，<code>F</code>和<code>G</code>是<code>C</code>的子结点。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"ed19c6df-7cda-3c8d-86ca-d2355b4a7fb2","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"F: 2 * 3 = 6\nG: 2 * 3 + 1 = 7","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":7},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"291b6f7f-2d90-3497-a229-e38c3c682164","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/5b9618d9216bd997ee1d.png","style":"original","caption":"Calculating Positions of Child Nodes (F and G) of Node C","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":318,"size_in_bytes":8419,"name":"dsa-12.1.7.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":8}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6b039ccd-e638-330d-9e68-b56fe3c00f54","knowledge_id":772,"title":"数组表示法的实现","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":3,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":772,"title":"数组表示法的实现","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"14ad4479-1702-36db-998b-63ffa3ff8e84","title":"","title_html":"","text":"到目前为止，假设第一个结点位于位置 **1**。然而，在执行过程中，数组索引是从**0**开始的，因此关系稍作修改如下：\n\n对于数组中索引为 `i` 的任何结点：\n\n- 左子结点位于索引 `2i + 1` 处。\n- 右子结点位于索引 `2i + 2` 处。\n- 父结点位于索引 `((i - 1) // 2)`。","text_html":"<p>到目前为止，假设第一个结点位于位置 <strong>1</strong>。然而，在执行过程中，数组索引是从<strong>0</strong>开始的，因此关系稍作修改如下：</p>\n<p>对于数组中索引为 <code>i</code> 的任何结点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>左子结点位于索引 <code>2i + 1</code> 处。</li>\n<li>右子结点位于索引 <code>2i + 2</code> 处。</li>\n<li>父结点位于索引 <code>((i - 1) // 2)</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Image","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e0a169d4-6f13-3d5c-9e01-8bd93e043513","image_id":null,"file":"/content/assets/359efac7e50e3e0c4774.png","style":"original","caption":"Adjusting Node Indexing for Array Representation of a Binary Tree","border_color":"#ccc","has_border":false,"metadata":{"width":1308,"height":920,"size_in_bytes":39376,"name":"dsa-12.1.8.png"}},"mode":"edit","step":1}]}},{"type":"Knowledge","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"7b16c49b-9b03-39d1-815f-67ba3f9a5f55","knowledge_id":773,"title":"思考过程：数组表示法","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":4,"resolved":{"knowledge_id":773,"title":"思考过程：数组表示法","knowledges":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2a62abb3-bf75-39fb-b498-218bb85adf24","title":"","title_html":"","text":"让我们看看数组表示方是如何实现。\n\n**1.查找父索引**\n\n对于数组中索引为`i`的结点，其父结点位于索引`((i - 1) // 2)`处。","text_html":"<p>让我们看看数组表示方是如何实现。</p>\n<p><strong>1.查找父索引</strong></p>\n<p>对于数组中索引为<code>i</code>的结点，其父结点位于索引<code>((i - 1) // 2)</code>处。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"2fef5e4e-0eb8-3764-921a-0486a27d7a22","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"#计算父结点的索引\ndef parent(self, index):\n    return (index - 1) // 2","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3c381023-d463-3d26-93e1-4875e75c976f","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**2.查找子索引**\n\n对于数组中索引`i`处的任何结点：\n\n- 左子结点位于索引 `2i + 1` 处。\n- 右子结点位于索引 `2i + 2` 处。","text_html":"<p><strong>2.查找子索引</strong></p>\n<p>对于数组中索引<code>i</code>处的任何结点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>左子结点位于索引 <code>2i + 1</code> 处。</li>\n<li>右子结点位于索引 <code>2i + 2</code> 处。</li>\n</ul>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":2},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"e8faa984-ba3f-3436-b734-bc1b08372e91","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"#计算结点左子结点的索引\ndef left_child(self, index):\n    return 2 * index + 1\n\n# 计算结点右子结点的索引\ndef right_child(self, index):\n    return 2 * index + 2","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":3},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"6694bad8-03aa-380d-a7df-24dc95595726","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**3.检查父结点是否存在**\n\n由于数组索引从**0**开始，如果父索引大于或等于**0**，就可以认为父结点存在。","text_html":"<p><strong>3.检查父结点是否存在</strong></p>\n<p>由于数组索引从<strong>0</strong>开始，如果父索引大于或等于<strong>0</strong>，就可以认为父结点存在。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":4},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"4197f334-8a1a-3afd-8173-2dd7b8c694ff","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 检查给定索引处的结点是否有父结点\ndef has_parent(self, index):\n    return self.parent(index) >= 0","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":5},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"3b5928fb-3f98-3ba2-98f7-4a073929d481","title":"","title_html":"","text":"**4.检查子结点是否存在**\n\n假设我们的二叉树用数组表示，那么只有当子结点的索引在数组长度范围内时，子结点才会存在。","text_html":"<p><strong>4.检查子结点是否存在</strong></p>\n<p>假设我们的二叉树用数组表示，那么只有当子结点的索引在数组长度范围内时，子结点才会存在。</p>\n"},"mode":"edit","step":6},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0cfe5c6a-8b4a-3588-bb30-e99c129f6f3f","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","short_content":"","content":"# 检查给定索引处的结点是否有左子结点\ndef has_left_child(self, index):\n    return self.left_child(index) < len(self.array)\n\n# 检查给定索引处的结点是否有正确的子结点\ndef has_right_child(self, index):\n    return self.right_child(index) < len(self.array)","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":false,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null},"mode":"edit","step":7}]}},{"type":"QuestionRef","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"725e0b16-6f17-365a-b1fa-5137e62975ea","title":"二叉树数组实现","question_id":3251,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":5,"resolved":{"question_id":3251,"title":"二叉树数组实现","description":"","description_en":"","knowledges":[],"question_type":"single_choice","question_text":"你能写出下面二叉树的数组表示吗？\n\n![](/content/assets/fdcc0811b4d0329019ba.png)","question_text_html":"<p>你能写出下面二叉树的数组表示吗？</p>\n<p><img src=\"/content/assets/fdcc0811b4d0329019ba.png\" alt=\"\" /></p>\n","question_options":[{"id":11429,"key":"A","text":"[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]","text_html":"<p>[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9]</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"这种表示法没有考虑到中间一些结点没有子结点的情况。","md_html":"<p>这种表示法没有考虑到中间一些结点没有子结点的情况。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11430,"key":"B","text":"[1,2,3,4,5,null,6,7,null,null,null, null,null,null,8,null,9]","text_html":"<p>[1,2,3,4,5,null,6,7,null,null,null, null,null,null,8,null,9]</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"这就是正确的表示方法。如果中间少了一些结点，数组也应该显示出来。","md_html":"<p>这就是正确的表示方法。如果中间少了一些结点，数组也应该显示出来。</p>\n"},"correct":true,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11431,"key":"C","text":"[1, 2, 4, 7, 9, 5, 3, 6, 8]","text_html":"<p>[1, 2, 4, 7, 9, 5, 3, 6, 8]</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"数组表示法提供了所有数据，但没有提供所有关系。","md_html":"<p>数组表示法提供了所有数据，但没有提供所有关系。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}},{"id":11432,"key":"D","text":"[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]","text_html":"<p>[0, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7]</p>\n","explanation":{"md_text":"在这个数组中，数据和关系都不正确。","md_html":"<p>在这个数组中，数据和关系都不正确。</p>\n"},"correct":false,"match_number":0,"max_length":0,"properties":{}}],"user_answers":null,"is_right":null}}],"status":"undo","course_no":"035","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/035/page/1596"}
